Scope. The MIT license above covers everything in this repository (source code,
configuration, tests, documentation, reports, the blog post and the demo page markup
and scripts) EXCEPT:

  (a) trained model weights and derived data, listed in LICENSE-WEIGHTS
      (web/model.json, docs/demo/model.json, everything under experiments/,
      data/processed/ and data/splits/);
  (b) data/manifest/license_evidence/, which holds excerpts of third-party license
      notices retained as evidence; those texts stay under their original terms and
      are not relicensed by this repository;
  (c) the figures under docs/img/, whose provenance and terms are listed in
      docs/img/README.md (grid_mabs.png reproduces palettes from the O'Donovan
      datasets in its retrieval rows).

Dependencies retain their own licenses (see uv.lock). Fonts used by the demo page
(Bricolage Grotesque; IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Mono) are loaded from Google Fonts
under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 and are not redistributed here.
